    <briefdescription>
<para>Deep nesting stress scenario for BPMN parser. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> Process model with nested sub-processes up to maximum depth <linebreak/>
 <bold>Maximum Depth:</bold> 100 levels (configurable) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Success with deterministic output (should complete in &lt;50 ms) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> <computeroutput>PROC_MAX_DEPTH_EXCEEDED</computeroutput> if max depth exceeded <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Deserialization succeeds</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Output model is deterministic (same as non-nested version)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Latency &lt;50 ms (P95)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No stack overflow or memory corruption </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
